                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:17]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage, off-guard, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} (1 round)</p>"
