        {
            "_id": "gPYX58j7CZXwbxyg",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Attach Sanguine Hose",
            "sort": 800000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Shulgurk attempts to embed a toothy sphincter at the end of a leather hose attached to his infernal machine in the flesh of a living creature that's also within 10 feet of the infernal machine. The torturer makes an infernal machine hose Strike against the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] creature, with a hit successfully attaching the hose to the creature, that's thereafter @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] and susceptible to Exsanguinate Subject until the hose is detached.</p>\n<p>Safely removing an attached sanguine hose from a living subject requires spending an action to attempt a @Check[crafting|dc:16] or @Check[medicine|dc:16] check, or a @Check[athletics|dc:20] check (these DCs increase by 4 (@Check[crafting|dc:20] , @Check[medicine|dc:20], @Check[athletics|dc:24]) if the Strike to attach the hose was a critical hit), with the following results.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The hose detaches without additional damage to the subject.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The hose detaches from the subject fairly cleanly, but the toothy sphincter at its end manages to take a chunk of flesh as a souvenir, dealing @Damage[1d4[piercing]] damage to the subject.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The hose separates from the skin with a sickening \"plop\" and a spurt of fresh blood. The subject takes @Damage[1d4[piercing],1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the subject also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained]{Drained 1}.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "manipulate"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
